  "title": "epan: tvb_ws_mempbrk implementation with unsigned offset and length and returning bool",
  "description": "Change the internal tvb_ws_mempbrk_pattern_uint8 functions to take an\nunsigned offset and maximum length, set the found offset via a pointer,\nand return a bool.\n\nAdd public functions that use this, while implementing the existing\nfunction using the new internal function.\n\nPing #20103",
