      "title": "epan: tvb_ws_mempbrk implementation with unsigned and returning bool",
      "message": "epan: tvb_ws_mempbrk implementation with unsigned and returning bool\n\nChange the internal tvb_ws_mempbrk_pattern_uint8 functions to take an\nunsigned offset and maximum length, set the found offset via a pointer,\nand return a bool.\n\nAdd public functions that use this, while implementing the existing\nfunction using the new internal function.\n\nPing #20103\n",
